                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1.5">2. Zero Third-Party Resale</h4>
                    <p class="mb-3 text-slate-300">We do not sell, rent, lease, or monetize your contact information to third-party telemarketers, ad brokers, or wagering platforms.</p>
