                    <p class="text-slate-300">Subscribers may opt out from alerts at any time by simply replying <code class="text-amber-400 bg-slate-950 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">STOP</code> to our WhatsApp alert desk or sending an opt-out message.</p>
                `
            },
            terms: {
                title: "Terms of Service • SHIVA SOLUTION",
                html: `
                    <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1.5">1. Pure Informational Service</h4>
                    <p class="mb-3 text-slate-300">SHIVA SOLUTION is an informational sports news aggregator and match telemetry desk. All reports, pitch summaries, and score updates are provided 100% free of charge.</p>
